Notice of changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b))
================================================================================

Foursquare OS Places records were obtained through Overture Maps Foundation releases 2026-09-23.1,
2026-10-21.0 and 2026-11-18.0, in which Foursquare data was transformed to the Overture schema.
GeoTrustOps further modified these records: selected fields were extracted and flattened, records were
clipped to a study area, compared between releases, classified, and written as GeoJSON/JSON/Markdown
outputs with added change attributes. Records from Foursquare are identified by "Apache-2.0" in each
output feature's source_licences property. Raw extracts supplied for verification are clipped to the
extraction area and are otherwise unchanged.
